       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg per day. A dose that high carries a serious risk of serotonin syndrome, seizures, and QT prolongation.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **100 mg** by mouth once daily. This is a common maintenance dose.\n- **50 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the usual starting dose.\n- **200 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the maximum dose.\n\nTell me the dose you intended and I'll enter it. If 1000 mg is really what you want, for example as part of a specific protocol, tell me that and I can add a note to the order. I'd still recommend confirming it with pharmacy first."
